B.aqn=s([B.b0s,B.b0N],t.L)
B.ah4=new A.k6("Terms","PACT","A shared understanding of the platform.","Read how Pact\u2019s tools, professional directory and transaction workspaces are intended to be used. Agree deal-specific obligations and professional services separately with the people involved.","",B.aqo,B.aqn)
